vior.&#10;- Different screen densities (DPI) and resolutions.&#10;- Display scaling and font scaling.&#10;- Device-specific OEM behavior (Samsung, Xiaomi, OnePlus, Pixel, etc.).&#10;- Absolute positioning issues.&#10;- Hardcoded heights, widths, margins, or paddings.&#10;- Bottom sheets, modals, and input bars.&#10;- ScrollView/FlatList layout differences.&#10;- KeyboardAvoidingView behavior.&#10;- Any race conditions during app startup.&#10;&#10;Verify the UI on:&#10;- Physical Android devices.&#10;- Different screen sizes and aspect ratios.&#10;- Gesture navigation and 3-button navigation.&#10;- Debug and Release (Production) builds.&#10;&#10;If an issue is found:&#10;- Fix ONLY the root cause.&#10;- Keep the fix Android-specific.&#10;- Do not modify unrelated files or existing working features.&#10;&#10;Finally provide:&#10;1. Root cause of the issue.&#10;2. Files modified.&#10;3. Exactly what was changed.&#10;4. Confirmation that no unrelated code or previous fixes were altered.&#10;5. Confirmation that the app layout is consistent on both the Android emulator and physical devices." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.brahmand.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[327,249][933,367]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /><node index="2" text="12:24 PM" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.brahmand.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[850,409][975,452]" drawing-order="3" hint="" /><node index="3" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="com.brahmand.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scro